# Conformance base for cleanup order and cleanup failure: two files, each released
# by a deferred cleanup that says when it runs.

cleanupOrder is project
cleanupOrder purpose "Show deferred cleanups running newest first, and what a failing cleanup does"
cleanupOrder target console
cleanupOrder version "0.1.0"
cleanupOrder language refined 1
cleanupOrder standardLibrary 1
cleanupOrder allows write console.stdout none
cleanupOrder allows write fs.files "cleanup-*"
cleanupOrder requires none
cleanupOrder includesModule cleanups
cleanupOrder entry cleanups.main
